      "text": "Police heroic deeds saved a bicycle rider injured in an accident.\n\n#MSNews | Three cops, namely Police Staff Sergeant Saul, Patrolman Luna, and Patrolman Geronimo, assisted a bicycle rider along Heritage Park service road on early Saturday morning (December 6) following a collision with a motorcycle.\n\nThe cyclist was transported by an ambulance and medical team from Barangay Pinagsama to the nearest hospital and is now recuperating from his injuries sustained from the accident. | via Vince Lopez\n\nFor more info, visit https://t.co/rmQCnNSOvI.",
